these potato pillows,

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.290
pressing these taters
through my garlic press.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.610
It's so fluffy.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:55.110
I have finished pressing
all of my potatoes

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.260
