third teaspoon of black pepper.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.870
I'm mixing everything
together with my hands.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:23.650
You can feel how well
everything integrates together.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.500
I'm gonna transfer it onto my surface.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:30.070
So I'm gonna continue kneading
this until it's smooth.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.640
All right, our potato dough is ready.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.510
It is so smooth.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:36.860
Okay, so what she does is she shapes it.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.480
She says you can do
whatever shape you want,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.810
