00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:03.350
the rest of my potato pillows.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.700
I got the hang of it.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.150
More pressure up top, less
pressure at the bottom.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.730
Ta-da, gorgeous.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.310
So I have my first batch done here.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.220
I'm gonna press down on the rest of these

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.250
