00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:31.213
Gonna put a few potatoes on my, this.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.330
So we're gonna add our
potatoes into our oil.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.470
Once your oil hits 350,

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:38.740
