00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.840
Nice and crispy!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:14.690
I'm gonna transfer my
potatoes onto this plate.

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:15.610
You'll see that the towels

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.510
have helped soak up that excess oil.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:21.550
I'm gonna add on a little bit of cayenne.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.240
We're gonna give it a little toss.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.590
Lastly, I'm just gonna
serve it with some ketchup.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.760
The bubble potatoes are done.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:32.710
Potatoes that over 63
million people have seen.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:33.703
Get some ketchup.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.240
The outside is super crunchy

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:41.780
