When you do a dry rub.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:20.940
Spicy and peppery.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:21.910
Salivating again.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.770
I think I chose some
really good recipes today.

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:24.740
Let's do it.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:27.960
All right, so I have my
king oyster mushrooms here.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.070
I am obsessed with these.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:30.970
These are so good.

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:33.370
We are just gonna cut the tips off.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:36.360
I like to take any veggie
scraps, put them in the freezer

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.650
